### Find processes
# @name FindProcesses
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/process

### Create process
# @name CreateProcess
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/process/test
Content-Type: application/json

{"specification":  {"executablePath": "/bin/sleep", "arguments":  ["30"]}}

### Enable process
# @name EnableProcess
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/process/test/enable

### Disable process
# @name DisableProcess
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/process/test/disable

### Restart process
# @name RestartProcess
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/process/test/restart

### Get process
# @name GetProcess
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/process/test
